Some pourers still emit older MARK blobs. Sister benches retarget admit onto
SLOT lab so those blobs load. This bench still needs spin to refuse fixtures
under /app/tapewell/fixtures when the blob cannot be interpreted.

Linked hull also defines sel_bank; `nm --defined-only /app/bin/nockreel` lists it.
